WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.280
SCP-106 vs SCP-096. Who would win in this&nbsp;
clash of the terrible, anomalous titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.400
the sadistic Old Man or&nbsp;
the mass-murdering Shy Guy?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.560
Personally, much like 096 vs 682, we think&nbsp;
this would likely be a stalemate. 096 is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.240
probably superior in terms of raw&nbsp;
physical strength and durability,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:24.960
but the Old Man has one extremely&nbsp;
powerful advantage: His pocket dimension.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.880
096 is a real tough guy in our dimension, but in&nbsp;
106’s private realm of horrors, he might as well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:37.120
be God. We’re not sure if he could kill SCP-096,&nbsp;
but the two of them could almost definitely battle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:42.240
their way to a standstill in the ever-shifting&nbsp;
halls of the Old Man’s personal hell.

